<item><title>Benin’s media ministry seeks 24.38% budget increase for 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-media-ministry-seeks-24-38-budget-increase-for-2027-24e215/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-media-ministry-seeks-24-38-budget-increase-for-2027-24e215/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The proposed CFA12,39 billion allocation includes funding for audiovisual production, professional training and wider broadcast coverage.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Benin’s Economic and Social Council urges stronger reporting of violence against women</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-economic-and-social-council-urges-stronger-ae9ac0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-economic-and-social-council-urges-stronger-ae9ac0/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>Abdoulaye Bio Tchané says laws and nationwide sessions need to be matched by prevention, easier reporting and support for victims.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:29:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Benin launches platform for microfinance loans of 50 000 to CFA50 million</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-launches-platform-for-microfinance-loans-of-50-000-to-a42998/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-launches-platform-for-microfinance-loans-of-50-000-to-a42998/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The national financial-inclusion platform lets registered clients choose offers, with repayment periods from three to 36 months and terms shown before signing.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:51:57 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
